/*
 * Delcares the FutureType class.
 *
 * A future value is a value being computed in a parallel thread that will be
 * return at some point. As a function pointer or other function related values,
 * the mutability of the return type is not defined by the mutability of the
 * value holding the future, but defined by the description of the function.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::native::scalar::future_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/native/scalar/future_.yr
